            <Label id="team_objective_ct" class="team_objective_text" text="OBJECTIVE: FIND THE CANISTER AND REACH THE ELEVATOR. SURVIVE AT ALL COSTS. YOU CAN ALSO COLLECT BOTTLES AND SPEND THEM AT THE SLOT MACHINE." />
